Third-party components
----------------------

Fonts (res/font/). Each font must be listed here with its source, copyright
holder and a licence compatible with GPL-3.0 redistribution (e.g. OFL-1.1).

  indopak_nastaleeq.ttf
    DigitalKhatt IndoPak, release v1.0.0-beta.1, based on the Quraan Al Majeed
    13-line IndoPak Mushaf. Copyright (c) 2024-2025 Amine Anane, Copyright (c)
    2024-2025 Tarteel Inc. Source: https://github.com/DigitalKhatt/indopakfont
    Licence: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (see LICENSE-OFL-DigitalKhattIndoPak.txt).
    Modified: CFF2 outlines converted to TrueType (glyf) and variation axes
    (LTAT, RTAT) pinned at their defaults with tools/otf_to_ttf.py, so Android
    7.x can load it. Layout tables are unchanged; no Reserved Font Name is declared.

  indopak_naskh.ttf
    Noto Naskh Arabic, Version 2.021, Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors
    (https://github.com/notofonts/arabic). Static Regular (wght=400) instance
    generated from the variable font with fontTools.varLib.instancer.
    Licence: SIL Open Font License 1.1 (see LICENSE-OFL-NotoNaskhArabic.txt).

Audio (assets/audio/). Every clip's source, SHA-1 and licence is listed in assets/content/sources.json.

  Letter recordings by Ruaa GHAREEB, from Wikimedia Commons
  (https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Ruaa_GHAREEB), licensed CC BY-SA 4.0.
  Modified: loudness-normalised to -16 LUFS and re-encoded as 16 kHz mono Opus at
  24 kbps by tools/build_content_pack.py. Matched to letters by file name and not
  yet verified by a fluent reader; release builds require that verification.

Letter data (assets/content/letters.json): letters, names and joining forms from the
Unicode Character Database (Unicode License v3); look-alike groups derived from the
DigitalKhatt IndoPak font; sound-alike groups from the Qaida product specification.

